  Description: Prerequisite Region - Absalom and Starstone Isle You grew up in an
    untamed region of the Isle of Kortos, and you know how to survive in the wild.
    Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Constitution or Wisdom , and one
    is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Survival skill and a Lore skill
    related to the terrain type associated with your home region (such as Hills Lore
    or Mountains Lore). You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Survey
    Wildlife] skill feat.
